assert    Fail the host during apply when a command fails.
certbot   Get a Let's Encrypt certificate with certbot.
cmd       Run a command.
debconf   Set an answer in the debconf database.
dir       Manage a directory.
download  Download a file or an archive and check its SHA-256.
file      Write a file, or set the owner, group, and mode of a file.
firewall  Filter the traffic that reaches the host.
group     Manage a group.
hostname  Set the static host name.
line      Keep one line in a file that another program owns.
link      Manage a symbolic link.
pkg       Install or remove packages with apt.
reboot    Reboot the host and wait until it answers again.
repo      Add an apt source and its key.
service   Start, stop, enable, or disable a systemd unit.
timezone  Set the time zone.
unit      Write a systemd unit file.
upgrade   Install the pending package upgrades.
user      Manage a user account.

Run "winch doc <module>" for the keys of a module.
